Citation:	Papenmeier, Svenja; Hass, H Christian (2019): Video observation during R/V Heincke cruise HE436 in the German Bight with link to raw data files [dataset]. Alfred Wegener Institute - Wadden Sea Station Sylt, PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.909999
Abstract:	At 44 stations in the German Bitght underwater videos were recorded with Kongsberg Color Zoom Camera and GOPRO 3+ Black Edition to ground truth sidescan sonar backscatter data. The R/V Heincke was drifting while data acquisition.
